---
// src/components/TerminalBlock.astro
// C 的局部元素：終端區塊（用於原理宣告與安裝指令，非全頁裝飾）
interface Props {
  title?: string;
  variant?: 'default' | 'sunk';
}
const { title = 'session', variant = 'default' } = Astro.props;
---

<div class:list={['term', { 'term--sunk': variant === 'sunk' }]}>
  <div class="term__bar">
    <span class="term__file">{title}</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">read-only</span>
  </div>
  <div class="term__body">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .term--sunk { background: var(--bg-sunk); }
</style>
